Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.06,0:00:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire culture of moe is gone from Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.30,0:00:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the Toranoana? The Animate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.42,0:00:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mandarake? The Gamers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.39,0:00:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would those be in Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.67,0:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to Nakano to get my comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.08,0:00:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you work part-time at MayQueen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.34,0:00:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Faris was the one who requested to bring the culture of moe to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She sent a D-Mail preventing that from ever happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With just one message,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the whole town changed.
