Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that MayQueen used to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen? Is that a potato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,During summer, I prefer noodles to potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't a potato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If MayQueen never existed, then how did we meet Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:03:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's thanks to potato ramen that we met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.11,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of the Rai-Net Tournament in Ikebukuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sick from the potato ramen I had for lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.28,0:03:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so I withdrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii and you entered as a pair,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and you went up against Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.75,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mayushii and Faris became friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.63,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought this cosplayer's photobook yesterday in Nakano!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The past changed, but our relationships haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to have lots of time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,on your hands with this Bon Festival, lab mem girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's Sedona from {\i1}Blood Tune{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really detailed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a swimsuit version too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.62,0:03:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have those proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.95,0:03:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.83,0:04:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Flat is justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.04,0:04:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not take all the lab mems and go to the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kurisu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, wear your school swimsuits, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.63,0:04:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going swimming with a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well... I mean, if it's just the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.19,0:04:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not be honest, Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.48,0:04:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone to see the mole on your rear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't go. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.61,0:04:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's just the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.82,0:04:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then Lukako can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.91,0:04:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.99,0:04:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.37,0:04:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That Lukako's actually a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.59,0:04:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real jerk, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you call a girl a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.39,0:05:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii doesn't like it when you say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that really mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.69,0:05:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Urushibara. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.65,0:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I apologize? It's true—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.16,0:05:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.07,0:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you think of me, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, Lukako! You're really...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Right here, you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.47,0:05:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone! There's nothing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.55,0:05:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako, you're a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been saying that this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Uh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit of torture...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,By Makise Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I've rectified the misunderstanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She got your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.00,0:06:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She made me sit on my knees for an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.05,0:06:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I mean, I was tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... That isn't torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.39,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost sound like you've been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.69,0:06:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect day for biking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.91,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.29,0:06:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you call biking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to Tokyo to find my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.14,0:07:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he disappear or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.23,0:07:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.44,0:07:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know he's in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my only clue...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,a badge he used to own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.62,0:07:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you shouldn't waste time at a part-time job, should you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.87,0:07:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some stuff going on, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad might show up tomorrow at a certain place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I miss that chance, I'll have to leave this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somewhere I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a busy person, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I always planned to give up if I couldn't meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.07,0:07:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.36,0:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your luck ran out the minute
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.41,0:08:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you spoke to the great mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now Lab Mem 008!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be our guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think me cruel if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no escape for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a D-Mail to your father before he leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him not to leave his daughter behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.65,0:08:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good person, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.53,0:08:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I feel a bit better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.37,0:08:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you see him tomorrow or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,come by the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use your sentimentality
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,for an experiment with the D-Mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible...{Nanoha laughing oh god my nutbladder}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.90,0:09:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now explain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the parameters of Operation Eldhrímnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,More Norse myths?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If the part-time warrior meets her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll hold a celebration,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,a last supper in Tokyo, for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.41,0:09:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she doesn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll try to cheer her up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.70,0:09:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and then send a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's meeting his online friends tonight,\Nso he said he can't join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've taken steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.19,0:09:47.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\b1\blur2.25\frx6\fry0\pos(903,69)\frz2.693}To: Daru
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.19,0:09:47.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.745\blur2.25\b1\pos(738,280.5)}Now is the time to choose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.19,0:09:47.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\a4\pos(351,835.5)\frz3.992\blur2.25\b1\fs90}Faris's cooking or your meeting. \NWhich will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's cooking or your meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Which will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But Faris can't come, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris has never met the part-time warrior,\Nso it's pointless for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but Daru has a duty to participate in this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I've never met this Suzuha person either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.32,0:10:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you all shopping for the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will follow the part-time warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.41,0:10:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and report in on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the father and daughter have their time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.38,0:10:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come shopping with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.88,0:10:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm following—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.63,0:10:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do, assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to sit on your knees again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This time for three hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then! Let's get things ready for the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:42.25,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs117\blur4.5\frz11.275\move(465,1182,513,1029,0,170)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:42.46,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs117\blur4.5\frz11.275\move(513,1029,534,801,0,210)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.33,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs118.5\blur4.5\frz11.275\pos(534,801)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:43.83,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs337.5\blur7.5\frz348.195\c&HC4C4C6&\pos(465,684)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:44.34,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs322.5\blur7.5\frz336.369\c&HB1B1B4&\pos(-567,21)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.41,0:10:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.62,0:10:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I think sweet curry will be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe spicy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.69,0:11:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Spicy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Suzu's a part-time warrior, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's a warrior, she'll want spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.24,0:11:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Next is the meat, the meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef sure is expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.21,0:11:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, you would've normally said...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Organization's interference has increased the price of beef!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Operation Time Sale begun?" or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.89,0:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need to use Norse mythology there, not "Time Sale."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's interference has caused unexpected expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.32,0:12:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in Operation Audhumbla.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm requesting additional funds for the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The first star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.21,0:12:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember in elementary school
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,when you got really sick with a high fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.75,0:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the world was panicking over Y2K.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii was really scared you would die then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I prayed to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, there was a shooting star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.61,0:12:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to the shooting star,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.65,0:12:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't die, Okarin!" three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.70,0:12:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And the next day, you got better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.66,0:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.46,0:13:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the choice of Steins Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that I survived back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.51,0:13:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember what you said
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,when you got sick and collapsed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,"Everything I saw began to flow together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.11,0:13:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and suddenly, I began to shake and couldn't stand up."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,in Faris's condominium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.45,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The feeling I had when I got that fever
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.58,0:13:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was just like the feeling I get when I move worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.79,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I attained my magic eye, Reading Steiner,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.21,0:13:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.80,0:13:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:13:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you smell something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the smell of Kurisu's apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.27,0:14:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.90,0:14:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Want Mayushii to help too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you boil an egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Can I use the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.57,0:14:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you microwave a raw egg, it'll explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.83,0:14:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you chop up the mushrooms, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.29,0:14:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.33,0:14:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need mushrooms or boiled eggs for apple pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the salad to go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think a boiled egg and mushroom salad really go with apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.13,0:14:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.05,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,stop chopping up mushrooms over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.39,0:14:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've released the seals that bound a dark god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.73,0:14:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't contact you within the hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,tell my parents I loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, do you have a rice cooker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida, you've been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.16,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris said she couldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I get a chance, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.55,0:15:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!{Fuck you!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really looking forward to my time machine forum meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.55,0:15:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machine forum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.55,0:15:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's with a sci-fi message board I frequent a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional author was supposed to go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an interestingly shaped mess kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a mess kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Future Gadget #4, Moad Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A claymore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made to look like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super-instant humidifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.88,0:15:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, couldn't we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.63,0:16:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A vacuum cleaner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Future Gadget #3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.85,0:16:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Or #2?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,#5!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And its name is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.64,0:16:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Once Again I Have Created Something Worthless"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.73,0:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,by Goemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it so you can use a vacuum cleaner's output to warm a dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.57,0:16:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When you use that, you need to turn off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,any other appliances, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...it'll trigger the breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Miss Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a radish.{daikon=large root, but also called white radish. also well-known by its nip name, but just being safe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, where's the breaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you walk around...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.55,0:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.14,0:16:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The breaker's in the front hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.65,0:16:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.03,0:16:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the lab I worked at in America had some of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the best people from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.99,0:17:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But they all had really huge egos,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.00,0:17:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so it was also a really hostile place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.96,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to them, your lab is really childish,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a fun place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not praising you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.05,0:17:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kinda thinking that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.89,0:17:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe I simply wanted friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.19,0:17:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of you as a companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.15,0:17:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me before, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.99,0:17:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That I was your dear companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That made me really happy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm trying to rethink my opinion of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she met her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.32,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're finally spending time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.69,0:18:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I told her to come to the lab either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.41,0:18:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aborting the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, go on home.
