Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she plan to leave the city by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, will not allow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.74,0:19:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.45,0:19:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I send a D-Mail telling myself to follow her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.37,0:19:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter what this afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.04,0:19:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is it okay for me to use D-Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to change the past any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a good person, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.97,0:19:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somehow, I feel a bit better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the great mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.06,0:19:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.91,0:19:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not give in to your assistant's threats.
