Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Part-Time Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Slacking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, we were all up really late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,we had a last supper for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so you could be our guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But the experiment never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know my dad's phone number.{phone's address, but come on}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to confirm something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.74,0:20:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.91,0:20:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're underage. You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.95,0:21:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was heading back from the time machine forum meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.42,0:21:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machine forum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where your dad was supposed to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my dad's calling himself Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,John Titor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.47,0:21:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not John... Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you take a video of it on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.15,0:21:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night was so fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been more fun without Makise Kurisu, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Her apple pie was absolutely horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But Urushibara Luka's curry was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lab's kinda nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.37,0:21:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's friends, and you always seem to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt like I fit in so much anywhere else in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're welcome anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.63,0:21:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.68,0:22:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lab mem now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.51,0:22:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to search for my father a little more!
